  "description": "Why Choose Actbest Ranger?\n\nWhether you're heading to work, cruising through the neighborhood, or riding into rolling hills, the Ranger's 1500W peak motor delivers up to 28 MPH, 80Nm of torque, and 35% hill-climbing capability to keep the ride feeling strong and responsive.\nThe 48V 13Ah removable battery provides up to 75 miles of range under ideal pedal-assist conditions, giving you more freedom for longer rides. When you get home, simply remove the battery and bring it indoors for convenient charging or storage.\nWith 26\" × 4.0\" fat tires, the Ranger feels planted and comfortable as you move from pavement to gravel, packed dirt, grass, and other mixed surfaces. The wider tires add grip, stability, and cushioning to help every ride feel smoother and more confident.",
